---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { catalog } from '../lib/site.ts';
import { readReleasePresentation } from '../lib/release.ts';
const repository = 'https://github.com/sawaki-zexi/anime-img-gen-prompts';
const release = await readReleasePresentation(catalog.catalog_revision);
const marketplaceRef = release?.marketplace_ref ?? 'plugin-release';
---
<Layout title="Agent 接入 · 动漫灵感工坊" description="动漫灵感工坊的 Codex CLI 安装方式与支持状态。">
  <div class="page-shell install-shell">
    <h1>Agent 接入</h1>
    <p class="support-status">CLI 实验支持 · 桌面端未验证 · 未上架官方目录</p>
    <section class="card install-status" aria-labelledby="install-title">
      <h2 id="install-title">Codex CLI 安装</h2>
      <pre><code>{`codex plugin marketplace add sawaki-zexi/anime-img-gen-prompts --ref ${marketplaceRef}\ncodex plugin add anime-prompt-atelier@anime-atelier-plugins`}</code></pre>
      <p>运行两步后开启新会话。后续内容更新无需重装。</p>
      {release ? <div class="install-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href={release.download_url} download>下载插件 ZIP</a></div> : <p>ZIP 下载在正式发布页提供。</p>}
    </section>
    <details class="card install-advanced">
      <summary>高级与兼容性</summary>
      {release && <><p>插件版本：{release.plugin_version}</p><p>MCP：<a href={release.mcp_url}>{release.mcp_url}</a></p><p>ZIP SHA-256：<code>{release.archive_sha256}</code></p></>}
      <p>其他 MCP 客户端仅完成协议验证；单独连接工具不包含插件 Skill。Codex IDE 扩展不支持插件。</p>
      <p><a href={`${repository}/blob/main/docs/plugin-installation.md`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">安装与兼容性记录 ↗</a></p>
    </details>
  </div>
</Layout>
